\ A public module word whose only call site sits inside a composite literal
\ (a quotation stored in a hash) must be discovered by freeze and bound at
\ the buried call site. The entry defines a colliding top-level `probe`; the
\ module's stored quotation must still run the module's own body.

m: "fixtures/composite_literal_callee_mod.1z" load ;

probe: ( -- fixnum ) [ 222 ] ;

probe .
m.caller
